# MaxOff environment variables.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. `.env.local` is git-ignored
# and Claude Code is blocked from reading `.env*`, so real keys never reach the repo
# or the chat (CLAUDE.md, engineering rule 10).
#
# Every new environment variable is added here, with a comment, by the task that
# introduces it. Supabase (0.2), Cloudflare R2, Resend, Web Push VAPID, Sentry and
# Google Drive variables arrive in their own phases.

# Absolute URL the app is served from. Used for links in emails and notifications.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
